[{"id":"CN-CAP-FAQ-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","502","504","排障"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(九)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(九)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/e25e16df/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":11,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>看到 502/504 还能继续抓 TCP 吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>可以，但问题已经至少到达某个 HTTP 网关；还要检查客户端到网关以及网关到上游的两段链路。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>只在客户端重复抓包可能看不到真正故障段，应同时看网关到上游的 DNS、TCP、TLS 和超时日志。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-008","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["TCP","关闭","FIN"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":8,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>TCP 常说的“四次挥手”为什么不是固定四个独立报文？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>两个方向可以独立结束，ACK 可能与数据或 FIN 合并，双方也可能同时关闭；四段只是常见时序。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>FIN 表示本方向不再发送字节，对端仍可能继续发送。应按状态和报文方向解释，而不是把四次当成不可变的脚本。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a9-coredump","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["崩溃","coredump"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位.md","articleTitle":"Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位","articlePath":"posts/cade4656/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位.md","articleTitle":"Linux(九)日志查看与故障定位","articlePath":"posts/cade4656/"}],"articleIndex":4,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>coredumpctl list 能否直接证明崩溃原因？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能，它只说明系统记录了转储；需要 info、符号和调用栈，并结合服务日志复核。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>转储含敏感内存，导出与调试必须在授权环境进行。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a13-handoff","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["交接","复盘"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十三)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十三)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/c0dffe07/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(十三)综合实战.md","articleTitle":"Linux(十三)综合实战","articlePath":"posts/c0dffe07/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>一份可复用的 Linux 故障交接至少包含什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>影响范围、时间窗、命令与关键输出、已证实/排除的假设、变更动作、复测结果和后续计划。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>把观察、推断和行动分开，接手者才能复核并继续定位。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-quality-assert","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","assert","测试","不变量"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(九)类型与质量保障.md","articleTitle":"Python(九)类型与质量保障","articlePath":"posts/62348dbe/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>为什么不能用 assert 校验用户输入或权限？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>优化模式可移除 assert，因此它不能承担生产环境必须执行的校验。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>assert 适合开发期检查内部不变量。用户输入、权限、金额范围和外部数据应使用明确条件与异常/错误结果，以保证任何运行模式下都被验证。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]